{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6F4FE1BC","title":"Why Did You Burn Me","entry":"Dlg_6F4FE1BC::entry","exit":"Dlg_6F4FE1BC::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_7B1398D3","articyId":"72057697117170426","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"What the blasted squall have ye been doing?!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What the blasted squall have ye been doing?!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35306","byteOffset":25718232,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_10CD2E0E","articyId":"72057697117170454","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"I asked, nay I commanded you with a set of simple instructions: spread the word of my deeds!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I asked, nay I commanded you with a set of simple instructions: spread the word of my deeds!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37895","byteOffset":28671504,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_55720F35","articyId":"72057697117170481","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Aye, but why'd yah spread that slanderous filth?","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye, but why'd yah spread that slanderous filth?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20948","byteOffset":15807336,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_815C02FB","articyId":"72057697117170496","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"I can see that! Me eyes read the article those people penned. Now I must work harder than ever to clear my name of such dirty water.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can see that! Me eyes read the article those people penned. Now I must work harder than ever to clear my name of such dirty water.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24209","byteOffset":17035216,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_92BCF955","articyId":"72057697117170518","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Everyone saw the blasted article! That be the problem. Aarrgh. So much unnecessary work to do now. Be gone with ye!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Everyone saw the blasted article! That be the problem. Aarrgh. So much unnecessary work to do now. Be gone with ye!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20725","byteOffset":15725248,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_2CB6D2FB","articyId":"72057697117170527","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"And ye made up those?! They be like bad reviews for the food you serve!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And ye made up those?! They be like bad reviews for the food you serve!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49089","byteOffset":32912072,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_8082F